  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Three funds, separate paths",
      "items": [
        "Pool fund = standard Genesis capital + leverage debt principal",
        "Preorder funds are ledgered separately, used for the first aggregated buy after the primary pool is created",
        "Success depends only on standard Genesis capital or leverage interest independently meeting the threshold"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How to read the ratios",
      "items": [
        "About 70% of the uAsset enters the primary pool; the remaining ~30% is the uAsset capital of the auxiliary pools (POL/uAsset + PT/uAsset)",
        "The minted POL splits roughly 2:3:2: 2 parts to the POL/uAsset pool, 3 split into PT + YT, 2 to the PT/POL pool; the PT then splits roughly 1:2",
        "The four-pool liquidity is locked for 365 days (hard contract constraint)",
        "Ratios follow the actual deployment execution"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Leftover assets",
      "items": [
        "Unused uAsset goes into the settlement reserve; the excess above the cap goes to the treasury",
        "Leftover Memecoin is burned",
        "Unused POL/PT is deployment remainder, claimed pro rata after unlock"
      ]
    }
  ]
